      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/a183cd/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-18T00:57:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Speaking of when my order might ship. Since today is Sunday nothing can be done but my kickstarter should have shipped with the P's, I live in Texas so it's not too long to get here but it still has not arrived. Normally I would be a lot more calm and less frantic about it but it feels like it's taking too long. I'm could just be impatient but I have no shipping number to check up on it and fedex hasn't always been very reliable with me so I'm a little concerned</p>",
