      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/y/779978/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-18T02:08:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The lack of tracking numbers coupled with the long shipping times has led to unneeded stress for many of us.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If it doesn't come tomorrow, I would suggest emailing Greater Than Games. They are supposed to get the tracking numbers at some point. I assume they would be more then willing to email you the number. They are also leaving for PAX at the end of the week, so I wouldn't wait until Friday.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If it makes you feel any better, I would guess that about a third of us have not gotten our orders yet.</p>",
